docs {
  ## POST /api/business-inquiries

  Public endpoint — no authentication required.
  Submits a B2B sales inquiry from the Manikan landing page.
  The form data is stored and appears in the Admin Panel for follow-up.

  ### Body
  | Field                | Type    | Required | Description                   |
  |----------------------|---------|----------|-------------------------------|
  | companyName          | string  | ✅       | Retailer company name         |
  | contactName          | string  | ✅       | Contact person's full name    |
  | email                | string  | ✅       | Contact email address         |
  | phone                | string  | ❌       | Phone number                  |
  | message              | string  | ✅       | Inquiry description           |
  | estimatedProductCount| integer | ❌       | Approximate SKU/product count |
  | websiteUrl           | string  | ❌       | Retailer's current website    |

  ### Success (201)
  ```json
  { "success": true, "message": "Your inquiry has been submitted. We'll be in touch soon!" }
  ```
}
